  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nCLOWERHILL, BALLINROBE, CO. MAYO\n\nc.30 ACRES PRIME AGRICULTURAL LAND\nFOLIO MY11699\n\nONLY c.2 MILES FROM BALLINROBE TOWN\n\nFOR OUTRIGHT SALE\n\nASKING PRICE: €500,000 O.N.O.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale approximately 30 acres of prime agricultural land at Clowerhill, conveniently situated approximately two miles from Ballinrobe town.\n\nLocated in one of the finest farming districts in the area, this is an excellent block of productive farmland being offered in one lot.\n\nTHE LANDS\n\nThe holding comprises approximately 30 acres of quality agricultural land which is predominantly level, well fenced and laid out in manageable divisions.\n\nThe lands have been actively farmed over the years and benefit from good access together with electricity, water and telephone services available/passing in the vicinity.\n\nThe property is situated in a renowned agricultural area and represents an excellent opportunity for an established farmer seeking to expand an existing holding or for anyone looking to acquire a substantial block of quality farmland close to Ballinrobe.\n\nLOCATION\n\nSituated at Clowerhill, approximately two miles from Ballinrobe town, in a well-established and highly regarded farming district.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\n• c.30 acres prime agricultural land\n• Folio MY11699\n• Predominantly level ground\n• Well fenced\n• Laid out in manageable divisions\n• Actively farmed over the years\n• Good access\n• Approximately two miles from Ballinrobe\n• For outright sale\n\nVIEWING\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel Dineen MIPAV MMCEPI\n086 213 0723\n\nOffice\n094 936 2216\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nEverything We Touch Turns to SOLD.\n\nDISCLAIMER:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. Areas, measurements and distances are approximate. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information, boundaries, services and other matters relating to the property.",
